// 20-35 min: turn diagram boxes into compilable signatures
class ParkingLot {
    private final List<ParkingFloor> floors;
    Optional<ParkingTicket> park(Vehicle v) { /* find spot, issue ticket */ }
    BigDecimal unpark(ParkingTicket t)      { /* fee, free spot */ }
}
interface FeeCalculator { BigDecimal calculate(ParkingTicket t); }
```
*Signatures and relationships matter more than full method bodies under time pressure.*

